WEBVTT

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:03.810
Come on, don't lick it so hard...

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:07.530
And by that, I mean...
don't watch from so close!

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:13.390
Happy new year, Darling!

00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:14.410
Here's to another wonderful year together!

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:15.180
New Year? I never met'er!
Here's to another wonderful year together!

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:16.040
Huh? Uh, okay.
New Year? I never met'er!

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:16.550
Huh? Uh, okay.

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:29.780
Aren't you glad we drew a "Great" love fortune?

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:31.100
Well, maybe...

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:33.660
Supposedly, couples that descend these stairs holding hands

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:35.340
will be blessed with many children!

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:36.740
Ch-Children?!

00:00:43.630 --> 00:00:44.550
H-Hey!!

00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:46.420
Darling!!

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:47.500
Rizel!!

00:00:52.850 --> 00:00:54.000
RIZEL!

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.400
I'm okay...

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:34.720
Sudden Shift in Attitude!! We've Done it Already,
and That's Enough!?

00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:39.810
Their relationship has shown no progress whatsoever in the past two weeks.

00:02:39.810 --> 00:02:43.150
And now, rumor has it that other nations have redoubled their research efforts,

00:02:43.150 --> 00:02:45.130
which makes our state
of stagnation all the worse.

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:48.630
He must've suffered
a very severe shock back then.

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:54.690
He's 15 years old, a delicate age fraught with peril. All we can do for now is watch and wait.

00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:00.060
What?!?

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:05.030
D-D-Did you s-say you did... "C"?!

00:03:05.030 --> 00:03:06.690
Exactly! All the way!

00:03:06.690 --> 00:03:08.190
S-So... how was it?

00:03:08.190 --> 00:03:09.610
It was really wonderful!

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:11.860
Eh? But... didn't it hurt?

00:03:11.860 --> 00:03:14.210
Huh? No, not at all.

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:18.840
It was like floating above an endless
sea of clouds and melting into ecstasy.

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:20.970
I-I wonder how they did it...

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:22.200
<i>That</i>  position?

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:23.840
Or maybe... like <i>that?!</i>

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:25.390
No way!!

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:29.770
Somehow, she looks really grown-up now...

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:30.500
Huh?

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:33.770
So Iwaki-kun was gentle with you?

00:03:33.770 --> 00:03:36.980
Yeah. He made me really happy when he
took the lead for the first time.

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:38.230
The first leading?!

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:40.490
But he's been acting strange since then...

00:03:41.210 --> 00:03:42.980
It's like he's giving me the cold shovel...

00:03:42.980 --> 00:03:44.730
Don't you mean "cold <i>shoulder"?</i>

00:03:44.730 --> 00:03:47.100
And we're even sleeping
in separate rooms these days.

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:48.980
What? That's like a divorced couple
living under one roof!

00:03:48.980 --> 00:03:50.270
Is that how it is?

00:03:50.270 --> 00:03:53.410
Oh, don't worry about it.
You went to "C" with him right?

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:58.000
Aha, I get it! I bet Iwaki-kun wants you
to take the initiative this time.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.020
I should?

00:03:59.020 --> 00:04:02.220
Yes, definitely! He's worried that he'd seem too horny if he kept asking you,

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:05.640
so he's waiting for you to ask him now.

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:08.210
Oh! My husband really is so bashful!

00:04:08.550 --> 00:04:10.000
So you have to take charge!

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:12.600
Okay, I'm taking charge!

00:04:16.310 --> 00:04:19.620
Darling! Say, Darling...

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:23.840
U-Uh, um, er...
Sorry, I have to go take a leak.

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:25.270
Huh? But...

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:31.390
I found you!

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:33.910
I f-f-forgot something!

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:34.540
Ah, Darling!
I f-f-forgot something!

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:35.520
Ah, Darling!

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:36.950
Why?

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:40.490
Darling. Darling? Darling!

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:42.360
Darling!

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:46.850
If you substitute X in here...

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:49.000
Darling!

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:52.290
S-S-Sensei!
I have to go to the nurse's office!

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:53.630
Ah, wait!

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:56.970
Why, Darling?

00:04:57.600 --> 00:04:58.930
Geez...

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:02.590
Why does she always have to be such a tease?

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:11.280
How could this happen to me?

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:13.800
It should have been my chance to prove my manhood, but...

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:18.540
...she's just a clueless kid, isn't she?

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:23.280
Why am I letting her turn me on like this?
What's <i>wrong</i>  with me?!

00:05:23.280 --> 00:05:26.000
We've never even been on a date...

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:27.930
I've found you, Darling!!

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:31.660
Darling!

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:33.070
Idiot! Let go of me!!

00:05:33.070 --> 00:05:33.720
Don't be shy, don't be shy!
Idiot! Let go of me!!

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:35.020
Don't be shy, don't be shy!

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:38.880
I told you to cut it out!!

00:05:39.340 --> 00:05:42.340
Whoa, it's our first time doing bandage bondage!

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:45.260
Her mind is way too simple...

00:05:45.260 --> 00:05:49.240
Rizel-chan, where are you?
Geez, where'd she run off to?

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:53.140
P-Please tell me they're <i>not</i> into medical roleplaying!

00:05:53.140 --> 00:05:56.780
Ah! Ryuunosuke-kun's scent... Woof woof!

00:05:56.780 --> 00:06:00.540
I'm sorry it took so long.
I simply had to put all my heart into it.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:05.280
No trouble at all. I'm just so happy that you made a lunch for one such as myself...

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:08.010
Later!

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:08.930
Okay!

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:11.540
N-No way... Why?!

00:06:14.010 --> 00:06:17.520
Oh, Seimoto-san. Thank you for the advice that you gave me the other day.

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:19.190
You were quite right.

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:22.660
There is no such thing
as an eternal 12-year-old.

00:06:22.660 --> 00:06:26.710
I found it - something in the real world that surpasses the angels...

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:29.990
...or even the Goddess of Mercy Herself!

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:32.100
To hell with that!

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:34.590
I thought you were only
interested in 12-year-olds!

00:06:34.590 --> 00:06:37.160
So you <i>weren't</i>  all about
the delicious flat chest?!

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:41.830
I was hoping to gradually
rehabilitate you back into society...

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:44.460
Ryuunosuke-kun, you idiot!!!

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:48.490
You guys always fall for the girls with big breasts! It's not fair!!

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:51.260
Thank the Maker, I'm free at last!

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:52.720
Ah, Rizel-chan!

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:54.880
We have to talk.

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:07.380
This sucks.

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:09.610
What's with the weird mood around here?

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:11.810
Iwaki-kun, Iwaki-kun!

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:14.870
Did you really do it?

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:16.590
Huh? Did I do what?

00:07:16.590 --> 00:07:19.440
You went all the way to "C"
with Rizel-chan, as in A-B-C!

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:21.830
Wh-Wh-Wh... WH... WHAT THE HELL?!?

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:24.170
W-WHO TOLD YOU A THING LIKE THAT?!

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:26.170
W-Who? Well, it was Rizel-chan-

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:27.450
That little...  OKAY, LISTEN UP!

00:07:27.450 --> 00:07:31.910
THAT IS UTTER NONSENSE, YOU GOT IT?!
I WASN'T ABLE TO DO ANY-

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:33.890
So that means you were <i>going</i>  to...

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:39.010
J-Just don't go spreading bogus rumors
based on your bogus conclusions!

00:07:39.010 --> 00:07:41.380
But everyone already knows! Look!

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:46.520
They've already gone and given you the nickname "Iwaki EROnori"!

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:50.180
What did I ever do to deserve such a lousy nickname?!

00:07:50.180 --> 00:07:51.110
Well, you know...

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:53.020
<i>You</i>  don't "know" anything, dammit!

00:07:53.020 --> 00:07:55.620
What? I have to give him <i>this?</i>

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:58.160
No matter how noble and manly
guys act at first,

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:02.160
they show their true,
irresponsible nature once they've "done it"!

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:06.130
He was so obsessed with 12-year-olds!
To hell with his "angels" and "goddesses"!

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:09.120
If that's the way he is,
then I say to hell with him, too!

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:10.420
B-But...

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:14.690
Don't give me any "buts"!
Have my instructions ever led you astray?

00:08:15.030 --> 00:08:17.650
Don't worry! He's sure to apologize for not being

00:08:17.650 --> 00:08:20.920
straightforward with you before.
Then he'll offer to kiss and make up.

00:08:21.220 --> 00:08:23.690
And you're wondering how to achieve that, right?

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:26.860
I know just the way...
Here! Follow this to the letter,

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:30.470
and you'll be absolutely safe, perfect, flawless, spotless, and invincible!

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:32.980
All right! Get going!

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:46.360
You look just like him...

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:49.820
Wanna head back to my place?

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:52.030
Damn it, where'd she run off to?

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:54.500
I really have to read this?

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:55.800
I'll find...

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:56.380
Rizel!

00:08:56.380 --> 00:08:57.050
Darling!

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:57.590
Why, you...!!
Darling!

00:08:57.590 --> 00:08:57.990
Why, you...!!

00:08:57.990 --> 00:09:00.080
Ah, um... er...

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:02.250
Just take a look at THIS!!

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:04.210
D-Divorce papers?!

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:05.750
Um...

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:10.420
You talked a fine game, but then you fell for a pair of big boobs! Have you no shame?!

00:09:10.420 --> 00:09:14.090
As if anyone would ever want to be with a weirdo like you anyway!

00:09:14.090 --> 00:09:17.590
Once I'm gone, it'll be too late
to learn your lesson.

00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:21.560
Huh...? I... I can't read it...

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:26.280
Let's see... I really tried to love you,
in the best way I knew how.

00:09:26.280 --> 00:09:28.670
I put all my heart into
showing you how I felt!

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:32.300
But lately, you've been so cold and brusque,

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:34.370
and you've been avoiding me so much...

00:09:34.370 --> 00:09:38.340
Basically, you haven't been treating me
like a real spouse at all!

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:40.210
That's not how a husband should be!

00:09:40.210 --> 00:09:42.650
That's not how a man should act!
There's no love between us at all!

00:09:42.650 --> 00:09:45.350
You're so unsociable, undependable, and uncourageous!

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:48.880
I-If you don't feel any remorse,
then just go ahead and sign this for me!

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:52.510
I don't have to stand here and take this shit.
You don't even know how <i>I</i>  feel.

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:57.360
All right, I'll sign it for you!
In fact, I'd be happy to!

00:09:58.130 --> 00:09:59.140
There!

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:02.350
Now we're total strangers! Goodbye!

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:08.070
No way! How did things come to this?

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:12.160
Now we're divorced...

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:22.960
What are you waiting for?!

00:10:23.500 --> 00:10:25.130
The Hawk has flown.

00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:28.010
May God bless us.

00:10:30.220 --> 00:10:30.880
Fire!

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:54.910
Nose dive! Nose dive!

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:01.140
Wh... what the...?!!

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:04.040
Hello, Darlin'!

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:07.180
I got all dolled up in your favorite clothes!

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:08.100
Here you go!

00:11:08.740 --> 00:11:11.840
Quit screwing around!!

00:11:11.840 --> 00:11:13.840
My first throw~!

00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:18.920
Oh my my, did I get it wrong, then?

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:23.870
I'm Lux - the prettiest girl in the universe!

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:28.440
Aren't you divorced, Darlin'?
That means you can marry <i>me!</i>

00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:30.820
Huh? Darlin'?

00:11:30.820 --> 00:11:32.760
Oh my God!

00:11:32.760 --> 00:11:35.160
I'll never let you go!

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:36.920
Wait up!!

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:40.580
That's Lux, from America!

00:11:40.580 --> 00:11:41.540
What did you say?!

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:43.500
Why has she suddenly shown up in Japan?!

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:46.420
Damn, she won't let up!

00:11:55.750 --> 00:11:58.390
Welcome home, my husband!

00:11:58.390 --> 00:11:59.930
W-W-What the HELL?!?!

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:01.770
Let's get married, Darling!

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:06.370
Darlin's new wife is me!

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:07.530
It's Lan-Lan!

00:12:07.530 --> 00:12:09.870
Nyet. He likes me, Rachel, the best.

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:11.480
It must be none other than Lobelia!

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:15.330
CUT THAT OUT ALREADY, YOU IDIOTS!!!

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:16.210
Why?

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:18.910
Can't you take a little "hard play"...?

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:21.330
W-W-Wait! No! You wouldn't...!!

00:12:24.470 --> 00:12:28.430
Lan-Lan, from China. Rachel, from Russia. And even Lobelia, from Italy...

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:30.380
What is the meaning of this?!

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:32.000
Come to think of it, where's Rizel?!

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:36.130
Well, she slipped away during the confusion,
and has gone missing.

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:38.040
She <i>what?</i>

00:14:09.840 --> 00:14:11.750
It's gotten super-cold around here!

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:13.440
No, things are getting really hot!

00:14:13.440 --> 00:14:14.400
Definitely...

00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:16.730
I'm worried Darlin' doesn't have
enough hair to stay warm in this cold.

00:14:16.730 --> 00:14:18.100
And now for a haiku:

00:14:18.100 --> 00:14:22.210
My Darlin' worries,
Because there is not much there:
His hair is quite thin.

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:23.850
That's the root of the problem.

00:14:26.710 --> 00:14:27.580
I'm Lux!

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:28.400
Lan-Lan, present!

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:29.510
Lobelia, too!

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:30.320
Rachel here.

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:34.460
Okay, in the next Rizelmine episode, I take a bath with amore mio.

00:14:34.460 --> 00:14:35.710
You know what you get when you have two chins?

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:37.500
Huh? Like with a dog or something?

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:38.860
Which "chin" do you mean?

00:14:38.860 --> 00:14:40.990
Oh, come on! Fine, I'm doing the poem myself.

00:14:40.990 --> 00:14:42.560
When in Nagoya,
When one accidentally

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:45.040
Overheats the bath,
It can also be called "chin."

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:48.320
Wow! We're even teaching you words in
Nagoya dialect! What a nice moe anime this is!

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:51.470
No no no, it's a
"Master of Entertainment" anime!

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:53.720
M-O-E!
